{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id421475684"}, "name":{"label":"tigergirl0117"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-01T05:54:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.21.0"}, "id":{"label":"13209083448"}, "title":{"label":"So far so good (and one suggested feature)"}, "content":{"label":"Great app so far. I decided to pay for the subscription cause I really wanted to track most of the times we spend together and it’s been fun. We answer the quizzes daily and get to know each other better more quickly. I also love that my lock screen has how many days we’ve been together and a message from him. One feature I’d love is if you could filter for just the special days instead of having to scroll through all the memories. Otherwise so far so good!\n\nEDIT: It’s been a few more months and I do mostly love the app. However, I did turn off the 18+ content and every once in a while the daily question is still a bit risqué which feels awkward. Most times we don’t answer, which luckily there’s streak freezes but it’s still a little frustrating. Otherwise a great app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
